              <p class="pmc-cs2-card__text">The Department of Rural Development &amp; Panchayati Raj, Jammu Kashmir faced fragmented implementation across multiple flagship rural development schemes, limiting visibility, delaying decision-making, and affecting beneficiary service delivery. PMC established an end-to-end consulting and program management framework to address this challenge.</p>
