              <h3 class="pmc-cs2-card__title">Reviving Khadi. Empowering Artisans.</h3>
              <p class="pmc-cs2-card__text">Jharkhand State Khadi and Village Industries Board (JSKVIB) operates a network of Johar Emporiums and artisan clusters across the state, serving thousands of weavers, craftspeople, and SHG members. Despite rich craft heritage, JSKVIB faced structural challenges. PMC was engaged to set up a Project Management Unit (PMU) and execute end-to-end reforms.</p>
