                  <p class="pmc-expert__bio">Priyaranjan is a strategy and governance expert with deep experience in policy, transaction advisory, and digital transformation across infrastructure, metals, IT, and consumer sectors. He helps clients navigate complex regulatory environments and deliver sustainable change. With a strong belief in data-driven governance, Priyaranjan enables organizations to strengthen policy implementation, optimize processes, and improve project outcomes through effective planning, monitoring, and execution.</p>
